<title>USA: BOXING-ROY JONES DISQUALIFIED, GRIFFIN GETS TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-ROY JONES DISQUALIFIED, GRIFFIN GETS TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, New Jersey 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montell Griffin won the World Boxing Council light heavyweight title from fellow American Roy Jones, Jr. Friday when Jones was disqualified at 2:27 of the ninth round for hitting Griffin when the challenger was down.</p>
</text>
